# In brevi

Live streaming is the streaming of video or audio, or both, in real time or near real time. While often referred to simply as streaming, the real-time nature of live streaming differentiates it from other non live broadcast forms of streamed media such as video on demand, video logs, and video sharing platforms such as [YouTube](https://youtube.com/).

St. Mary's Church Bonita Springs uses audio equipment, video cameras, audio mixing hardware, and various software programs to create a live stream of the Holy Eucharist and its many forms. Our videos are available on our [YouTube channel](https://www.youtube.com/@stmarysbonita).

This job aid serves to guide to set up and be ready to live stream. With a modest amount of instruction, anyone can do this.

