# YouTube

St. Mary's has a nonprofit [YouTube channel](https://www.youtube.com/@stmarysbonita). This channel is managed by Fr. Ryan Wright, Ian Mitchell, Joanna Wragg, and Gilles Pilon. Videos are automatically saved after streaming. The [church website](https://www.stmarysbonita.org/) only shows a live stream video. All other videos are archived on the [YouTube channel](https://www.youtube.com/@stmarysbonita). Content on the channel is managed using [studio.youtube.com](https://studio.youtube.com).

- Log into [https://studio.youtube.com](https://studio.youtube.com).
- In the upper right corner of the screen you should see our church icon. Click on the icon, click on <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Switch account</span> and ensure you are on the `St. Mary's Episcopal Church` account.
- This should take you to the `Channel dashboard.`

## Uploading a video manually

- Log into [https://studio.youtube.com](https://studio.youtube.com).
- In the upper right corner of the screen you should see our church icon. Click on the icon, click on <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Switch account</span> and ensure you are on the `St. Mary's Episcopal Church` account.
- This should take you to the `Channel dashboard.`
- In the top right corner, <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Create</span> and <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Upload videos</span> and <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Select files</span>
- Navigate to the file you wish to upload. Select it and <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Open</span>
- Title: <span style="color:blue; font-weight:bold">May 17, 2026 10:00 Holy Eucharist Rite II</span>
- Description: <span style="color:blue; font-weight:bold">The Seventh Sunday of Easter. The Sunday after Ascension Day.</span>
- Thumbnail: Ignore because YouTube will generate one and it's usually acceptable. You can change this later.
- Playlists: Select one if appropriate
- Audience: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">No, it's not made for kids</span>
- Age restriction: Ensure it is unchecked
- <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Show more</span>
- Paid promotion: Ignore
- Altered content: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">No</span>
- Collaboration: Ignore
- Automatic chapter: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Allow automatic chapters and key moments</span>
- Automatic concepts: Ensure it is unchecked
- Tags: Ignore
- Video language: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">English (United States)</span>
- Caption certification: Ignore
- Recording date and location: Enter the date from the drop down calendar. Enter the location <span style="color:blue; font-weight:bold">Bonita Springs, FL</span>
- License: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Standard YouTube License</span>
- Allow embedding: Ensure it is unchecked
- Publish to subscriptions feed and notify subscribers: Ensure is is checked
- Shorts remixing: Ensure <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Don't allow remixing</span> is checked
- Category: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">People & Blogs</span>
- Comments and rating:
    - Comments: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">On</span>
    - Moderation: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Strict</span>
    - Who can comment: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Anyone</span>
    - Sort by: <span style="color:red; font-weight:bold">Top</span>
    - Show how many viewers like this video: Ensure it is checked
