## Preparing for a live stream a day or more in advance

- Log into [https://studio.youtube.com](https://studio.youtube.com).
- In the upper right corner of the screen you should see our church icon. Click on the icon, click on <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Switch account</span> and ensure you are on the `St. Mary's Episcopal Church` account.
- This should take you to the `Channel dashboard.`
- There are three icons in the upper right corner. Click on the middle icon, the <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Go live</span> icon.
- This should take you to the `Manage` page. If not, click on the <span style="color:lightcoral; font-weight:bold">Manage</span> icon on the left side.
